! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''ce'e''

;__ce'e__ (CEhE): afterthought termset -- links terms into an afterthought termset --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ce'e'' Usage

mi klama le zarci ce'e le briju pe'e je le zdani ce'e le ckule%%%
''I go to the store from the office and from the store to the school.''%%%

!! Proposed Definition of ''nu'i''

;__nu'i__ (NUhI): start fore termset -- start forethought termset construct; marks start of place structure set with logical connection --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''nu'i'' Usage

i abu troci le nu vreta gi'e punji nu'ige lo cidni le lamji be le vorme gi le drata birka le sruri be le stedu%%%
''She tried the effect of lying down with one elbow against the door, and the other arm curled round her head.''


!! Proposed Definition of ''nu'u''

;__nu'u__ (NUhU): end fore termset -- elidable terminator: end forethought termset; usually elidable except with following sumti --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''nu'u'' Usage

(see nu'i)

!! Proposed Definition of ''pe'e''

;__pe'e__ (PEhE): termset conn mark -- marks the following connective as joining termsets --
** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''pe'e'' Usage

(see ce'e)

